learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:1: trailing whitespace.
+Feature: Reconcile a synthetic controller restart without repeating destructive data events
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:2: trailing whitespace.
+  The console is an available browser UI, not a running controller.
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:3: trailing whitespace.
+  Every destructive transition is a DATA ONLY entry in a fixed teaching trace.
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:4: trailing whitespace.
+  The crash occurs after one retirement effect and before its checkpoint advances.
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:5: trailing whitespace.
+  Three declared synthetic user journeys always remain in the denominator.
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:6: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:7: trailing whitespace.
+  Scenario: Restore a completed effect from its durable receipt
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:8: trailing whitespace.
+    Given complete synthetic effect and user-outcome receipts
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:9: trailing whitespace.
+    When I stage the crash and restart with durable reconciliation
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:10: trailing whitespace.
+    Then the retirement effect has one execution and zero duplicate destructive actions
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:11: trailing whitespace.
+    And the stale checkpoint advances to COMPLETE without replay
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:12: trailing whitespace.
+    And all three user outcomes are restored or completed
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:13: trailing whitespace.
+    And the result is SUCCESS with the console available throughout
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:14: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:15: trailing whitespace.
+  Scenario: Unsafe resumption repeats destructive work
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:16: trailing whitespace.
+    Given the same stale checkpoint and complete receipts
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:17: trailing whitespace.
+    When I restart by unsafely replaying the checkpoint
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:18: trailing whitespace.
+    Then the same retirement identity appears twice in the data trace
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:19: trailing whitespace.
+    And one duplicate destructive action makes the result FAILURE
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:20: trailing whitespace.
+    And three successful user outcomes cannot conceal that failure
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:21: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:22: trailing whitespace.
+  Scenario: Missing effect receipt cannot authorize a replay
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:23: trailing whitespace.
+    Given a missing durable effect receipt
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:24: trailing whitespace.
+    When I restart with durable reconciliation
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:25: trailing whitespace.
+    Then no second destructive event is appended
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:26: trailing whitespace.
+    And progress is RECONCILE_REQUIRED, one journey is unresolved, and the result is UNKNOWN
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:27: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:28: trailing whitespace.
+  Scenario: A lost user receipt stays in the denominator
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:29: trailing whitespace.
+    Given a missing pre-crash user-outcome receipt
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:30: trailing whitespace.
+    When I restart with durable reconciliation
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:31: trailing whitespace.
+    Then two user journeys succeed and one remains UNKNOWN out of three attempted
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:32: trailing whitespace.
+    And a completed checkpoint does not make the result SUCCESS
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:33: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:34: trailing whitespace.
+  Scenario: A recorded user interruption survives recovery
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:35: trailing whitespace.
+    Given one recorded pre-crash user failure
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:36: trailing whitespace.
+    When I restart with either policy
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:37: trailing whitespace.
+    Then that failure remains counted and the result is FAILURE
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:38: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:39: trailing whitespace.
+  Scenario: Learner prediction is separate from the trace result
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:40: trailing whitespace.
+    Given an unsafe resumed trace with result FAILURE
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:41: trailing whitespace.
+    When I predict SUCCESS and check the attempt
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:42: trailing whitespace.
+    Then the prediction is incorrect and the result remains FAILURE
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:43: trailing whitespace.
+    And the configuration, full trace, metrics, and outcomes are retained
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:44: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:45: trailing whitespace.
+  Scenario: Exact inputs and ordered actions
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:46: trailing whitespace.
+    Given a fresh exercise
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:47: trailing whitespace.
+    Then restart, check, and new-attempt actions are rejected without state mutation
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:48: trailing whitespace.
+    And missing, extra, malformed, or unsupported configuration fields are rejected
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:49: trailing whitespace.
+    And only one crash staging, restart, and check is allowed per attempt
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:50: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:51: trailing whitespace.
+  Scenario: History is bounded without silently evicting evidence
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:52: trailing whitespace.
+    Given six checked attempts
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:53: trailing whitespace.
+    Then starting another attempt is rejected
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:54: trailing whitespace.
+    And all six full records remain available until explicit reset
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:55: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:56: trailing whitespace.
+  Scenario: Keyboard, error, and reset operation
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:57: trailing whitespace.
+    Given the lesson opened with the exact synthetic training banner
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:58: trailing whitespace.
+    When I use keyboard controls through a safe attempt and a new unsafe attempt
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:59: trailing whitespace.
+    Then both outcomes and their histories remain inspectable
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:60: trailing whitespace.
+    And a tampered input causes a visible alert without changing model state
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:61: trailing whitespace.
+    When I activate explicit reset
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:62: trailing whitespace.
+    Then configuration, prediction, trace, metrics, errors, and history return to defaults
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:63: trailing whitespace.
+    And focus returns to the first configuration control
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:64: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:65: trailing whitespace.
+  Scenario: Browser content policy
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:66: trailing whitespace.
+    Given the real lesson DOM with its enforced content security policy
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:67: trailing whitespace.
+    Then local scripts and styles work without unsafe flags
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:68: trailing whitespace.
+    And an actual inline-script probe and connection probe are blocked
learning/S083/evidence/raw/red/controller-restart.feature.snapshot:69: trailing whitespace.
+    And there are no external requests or unexpected page errors
