+# Web Demonstration Harness Backlog
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/backlog.working.snapshot:2: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/backlog.working.snapshot:3: trailing whitespace.
+## Purpose and scope
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/backlog.working.snapshot:4: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/backlog.working.snapshot:5: trailing whitespace.
+Implement a browser-accessible demonstration harness for the strategies and scenarios in [README.md](../../README.md). An interested party must be able to discover a demo, understand its prerequisites, conduct it through a web UI, observe real outcomes, and reset or export the run without installing Azure CLI, kubectl, or application-development tools.
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/backlog.working.snapshot:6: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/backlog.working.snapshot:7: trailing whitespace.
+Atomic delivery cards, Kano completion rules, and the three-column pull policy are in [kanban.md](kanban.md).
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/backlog.working.snapshot:8: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/backlog.working.snapshot:9: trailing whitespace.
+Source baseline: [README.md at commit a1411c1](https://github.com/chadhage/app-scaling-strategies/blob/a1411c1fd7b081e7772db0ac96eb61d697452c86/README.md).
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/backlog.working.snapshot:10: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/backlog.working.snapshot:11: trailing whitespace.
+This backlog contains:
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/backlog.working.snapshot:12: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/backlog.working.snapshot:13: trailing whitespace.
+- 12 shared harness stories, H001-H012.
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/backlog.working.snapshot:14: trailing whitespace.
+- 7 platform and fixture enablers, P001-P007.
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/backlog.working.snapshot:15: trailing whitespace.
+- 150 individually selectable scenario-demo stories, D-S001 through D-S150, mapped one-to-one to S001-S150 in the source.
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/backlog.working.snapshot:16: trailing whitespace.
+- 2 integrated guided demonstrations, W001-W002, covering deployment rings and side-by-side getProfile version promotion.
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/backlog.working.snapshot:17: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/backlog.working.snapshot:18: trailing whitespace.
+All 171 items are **Planned**. This document does not implement the harness, provision resources, or establish a reliability guarantee.
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/backlog.working.snapshot:19: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/backlog.working.snapshot:20: trailing whitespace.
+The source catalog includes deployment strategies, supporting capabilities, failure-injection scenarios, and acceptance tests. Preserve all 150 entries as distinct runnable demonstrations rather than incorrectly treating every entry as a separate deployment mechanism.
