learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/backlog.working.snapshot:450: trailing whitespace.
+| M1: Harness foundation | H002-H012, P001/P002, and P005, implemented in dependency order. | A publicly discoverable catalog and authenticated leased execution path work; security/accessibility/recovery checks pass; unsupported/planned entries cannot execute. |
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/backlog.working.snapshot:451: trailing whitespace.
+| M2: First complete demonstrations | P0 D-S items and W001/W002, including their actual prerequisites. | Interested parties can conduct baseline migration, private preview, rings, scale, guarded failure, rollback, and retirement through the hosted UI with client evidence. |
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/backlog.working.snapshot:452: trailing whitespace.
+| M3: Broader compatibility/platform coverage | P003/P004/P007 and remaining P1 protocol, runtime, data, worker, and platform demonstrations. | Every supported source strategy has a working card on an appropriate host; native host claims have target-host evidence. |
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/backlog.working.snapshot:453: trailing whitespace.
+| M4: Advanced failure domains | P006 and P2 experiments, with explicit cost/risk approvals. | Privileged experiments remain isolated/bounded; outage proxies and platform limits are visible; recovery and cleanup are verified. |
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/backlog.working.snapshot:454: trailing whitespace.
+| M5: Coverage and evidence completion | All remaining D-S items, matrix coverage, soak/statistical collection, learner documentation, and operational readiness. | All 150 cards and both guided workflows meet the shared definition of done; exclusions and insufficient evidence are explicit; no unverified reliability claim is published. |
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/backlog.working.snapshot:455: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/backlog.working.snapshot:456: trailing whitespace.
+Do not treat milestone order as an implicit dependency. The item-level prerequisites are authoritative; independent components can proceed in parallel. No story-point, delivery-date, or Azure-cost estimate is asserted before the approved implementation and capacity choices exist.
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/backlog.working.snapshot:457: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/backlog.working.snapshot:458: trailing whitespace.
+## Completion and evidence policy
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/backlog.working.snapshot:459: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/backlog.working.snapshot:460: trailing whitespace.
+The source goal is:
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/backlog.working.snapshot:461: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/backlog.working.snapshot:462: trailing whitespace.
+```text
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/backlog.working.snapshot:463: trailing whitespace.
+Uninterrupted-transition success =
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/backlog.working.snapshot:464: trailing whitespace.
+    uninterrupted successful transition journeys
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/backlog.working.snapshot:465: trailing whitespace.
+    / all attempted transition journeys
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/backlog.working.snapshot:466: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/backlog.working.snapshot:467: trailing whitespace.
+Target >= 0.99999
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/backlog.working.snapshot:468: trailing whitespace.
+```
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/backlog.working.snapshot:469: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/backlog.working.snapshot:470: trailing whitespace.
+The UI must count errors, timeouts, over-budget latency, unexpected logout/state loss, missing/duplicate effects, and violated data contracts as interruptions. Unknown started outcomes cannot be excluded or presented as successful. Empty samples and users never moved to the candidate provide no migration proof.
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/backlog.working.snapshot:471: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/backlog.working.snapshot:472: trailing whitespace.
+For zero failures in independent comparable Bernoulli trials:
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/backlog.working.snapshot:473: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/backlog.working.snapshot:474: trailing whitespace.
+```text
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/backlog.working.snapshot:475: trailing whitespace.
+p_upper = 1 - 0.05^(1/n)
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/backlog.working.snapshot:476: trailing whitespace.
+n >= ceil(ln(0.05) / ln(1 - 0.00001)) = 299572
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/backlog.working.snapshot:477: trailing whitespace.
+```
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/backlog.working.snapshot:478: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/backlog.working.snapshot:479: trailing whitespace.
+The 299,572-trial figure is an illustrative one-sided 95% confidence bound, not a universal proof threshold. Correlated users within a swap, repeated requests from one user, changed operating envelopes, and outage emulation require explicit analysis and qualification.
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/backlog.working.snapshot:480: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/backlog.working.snapshot:481: trailing whitespace.
+Successful educational execution of a negative test does not satisfy the uninterrupted-transition goal. Keep verification verdicts, actual user impact, and cleanup status independently visible.
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/backlog.working.snapshot:482: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/backlog.working.snapshot:483: trailing whitespace.
+This backlog inherits the [Microsoft Open Source Disclaimer](../../README.md#microsoft-open-source-disclaimer). It does not assign a license, imply Microsoft endorsement/support, or turn the five-nines target into a Microsoft service-level agreement.
