+## Problem Statement
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/readme.working.snapshot:65: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/readme.working.snapshot:66: trailing whitespace.
+Scaling Web Applications under a high available operating conditions is challenging as the amount of tolerable disruption due to swap nears 0.
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/readme.working.snapshot:67: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/readme.working.snapshot:68: trailing whitespace.
