learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/readme.working.snapshot:69: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/readme.working.snapshot:70: trailing whitespace.
+Demonstrate all the strategies to scale an n-tier, web application, with zero interruptions to the end user experience.
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/readme.working.snapshot:71: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/readme.working.snapshot:72: trailing whitespace.
+## Goal Statement
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/readme.working.snapshot:73: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/readme.working.snapshot:74: trailing whitespace.
+Swap users across application slots, with 99.999% success of achieving zero interruptions to the end user experience.
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/readme.working.snapshot:75: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/readme.working.snapshot:76: trailing whitespace.
+To do so, the following scenarios below have been outlined
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/readme.working.snapshot:77: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/readme.working.snapshot:78: trailing whitespace.
