+
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/readme.working.snapshot:80: trailing whitespace.
+This document expands the scenarios in [background.md](background.md) into a catalog of 150 demonstration and test candidates. The goal is to preserve complete user journeys, not merely endpoint availability.
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/readme.working.snapshot:81: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/readme.working.snapshot:82: trailing whitespace.
