learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/readme.working.snapshot:109: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/readme.working.snapshot:110: trailing whitespace.
+Deployment changes, capacity scaling, and failure recovery are separate axes. Moving traffic to another slot does not itself add compute, and scaling one tier can overload another.
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/readme.working.snapshot:111: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/readme.working.snapshot:112: trailing whitespace.
+For App Service and eligible Functions plans, "slots" means actual deployment slots. For Container Apps and AKS, demonstrate equivalent revision or deployment transitions without pretending those platforms expose App Service slots.
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/readme.working.snapshot:113: trailing whitespace.
