learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/readme.working.snapshot:114: trailing whitespace.
+Before each demonstration, declare:
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/readme.working.snapshot:115: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/readme.working.snapshot:116: trailing whitespace.
+- Hosting model, deployment format, SKU, region, and relevant platform limits.
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/readme.working.snapshot:117: trailing whitespace.
+- User journeys, protocols, and compatibility requirements.
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/readme.working.snapshot:118: trailing whitespace.
+- Minimum, normal, and peak load, including overlapping deployment demand.
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/readme.working.snapshot:119: trailing whitespace.
+- Journey latency budgets and maximum supported request/job durations.
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/readme.working.snapshot:120: trailing whitespace.
+- Dependency capacity, data freshness, ordering, and transaction guarantees.
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/readme.working.snapshot:121: trailing whitespace.
+- Supported failure conditions and required surviving capacity.
learning/S083/evidence/raw/source/readme.working.snapshot:122: trailing whitespace.
+- Drain, rollback-retention, and recovery budgets.
